OL,3,GNEWSAFine Gael leader wants border poll
OL,4,Acriteria talks with London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Fine Gael, Simon Harris,
OL,7,Fhas said that a conversation between
OL,8,Fthe British and Irish governments over
OL,9,Fthe criteria for a border poll would be
OL,10,F"useful".
OL,12,FHarris, who is the tanaiste (Irish
OL,13,Fdeputy prime minister), said he and the
OL,14,FTaoiseach (Irish PM) Micheal Martin are
OL,15,F"aligned" on the issue.
OL,17,FHe said there could be joint Irish
OL,18,Fgovernment proposals on Irish unity
OL,19,Fpreparation "by the end of the year".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
