OL,3,GNEWSAFine Gael leader wants border poll
OL,4,Acriteria talks with London
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after the Northern Ireland
OL,7,FSecretary of State Sir Chris Bryant
OL,8,Fsaid that it is his job to decide when
OL,9,Fto bring forward a border poll and that
OL,10,Fhe does not "detect a mood" for it.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
